WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.050
Four robotic arms.

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:04.050
Twelve modular instrument towers.

00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:06.200
Under six hundred square feet.

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:13.820
Multiply Labs says its cluster is designed to work with GMP instruments teams already use.

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:20.050
Its software translates protocols into robotic execution and captures process records for quality review.

00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:24.711
This illustrative preview opens a conversation about process fit and scale.
